@description "Phase 10b sub-step 1 — default sound identifier (jingle codeName) for a type via the Soundable typeclass. Audio analogue of `getIcon`. Returns `Just String` on hit, `Nothing` on miss. Boundary adapter; dispatched via `dispatchedGetSound`. Mirrors implementations/typescript/engine/src/identifiable.ts:getSound."
@tags "engine" "identifiable" "representational" "dispatch" "phase-10b"
